            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article reports on research to identify nurses' knowledge of pain and its management in older people in acute hospitals. A quantitative descriptive cross-sectional design was adopted to survey a convenience sample of nurses. Data were collected using the Pain in the Elderly Questionnaire.</AbstractText>
